      "widgets_values": [
        "# MiniMax H3 Prompt Writers\n\n**Repository:**  \nhttps://github.com/raffaele-pet/ComfyUI-RPNodes\n\nThese three nodes use **Gemma 4** to analyze the request and any connected media, generating optimized prompts for **MiniMax H3**.\n\n## RP H3-T2V Prompt Writer\n\nGenerates a complete **Text-to-Video** prompt. Optional images, videos, and audio are used only as creative guidance during analysis.\n\nThe final prompt is fully self-contained and contains no `Picture`, `Video`, `Audio`, or `Subject` reference tags.\n\n## RP H3-I2V Prompt Writer\n\nGenerates **Image-to-Video** prompts from one to nine ordered images. With **RP H3-Keyframes** it supports multiframe generation; without it, it works as a standard first/last-frame prompt writer.\n\n## RP H3-REF2V Prompt Writer\n\nGenerates **Reference-to-Video** prompts from connected images, videos, and audio.\n\nIt preserves the `<Picture N>`, `<Video N>`, `<Audio N>`, and `<Subject N>` tags required by MiniMax H3 to associate each element with its corresponding source."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
